  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Bangladesh Environmental Lawyers Association for staff attendance at COP30</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will enable Mr Bareesh Hasan Chowdhury, BELA&apos;s Campaign and Policy Coordinator to participate in the COP 30 meetings that will take place in Belen, Brazil from 10 to 21 November, 2025.   He will be part of the Government of Bangladesh&apos;s state delegation as one of 5 &quot;youth negotiators&quot; with a particular focus on climate finance.</narrative>
